{
  "comment": [
    "The project-state layout contract shared by the Rust integration CLI and",
    "the TypeScript lab (#104). This file is the single source both suites",
    "check: crates/pickforge-cli/tests/state_layout.rs and",
    "packages/core/test/state-layout.test.ts. Changing one implementation's",
    "table without changing this file fails both suites, so the two tools",
    "cannot silently diverge.",
    "",
    "Owners: 'shared' is written by both tools, 'integration' by the Rust CLI,",
    "'transient' is an in-flight write by either tool, and 'foreign' is owned by",
    "nobody and refused rather than adopted."
